# Normalize line endings. Text files are stored with LF in the repository and
# checked out with LF on every platform, so Prettier's `format:check` and CI
# behave identically on Windows, macOS, and Linux. Prevents the "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF" warnings on Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly treat common binary types as binary (never normalized or diffed).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
